OL,5,G1520 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FThe competition commences at
OL,7,     FChurchill's Hotel in Barnsley, run
OL,8,     Fby Jeff and Vicky. Their ethos is
OL,9,     Fluxury for less, but will their
OL,10,     Ffirst-ever breakfast service
OL,11,     Fdamage their chances?
OL,12,G1550 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FDanni and Graham host at Darnells'
OL,14,     FFarm Luxury Glamping in
OL,15,     FHerefordshire. Will luxury
OL,16,     Flodgings and a race through a maze
OL,17,     Fwin them the week?
