OL,5,G1620 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FOn day three, Natasha and Laura
OL,7,     Fhost at Hatton Court Hotel in
OL,8,     FGloucester. The classic country
OL,9,     Fstyle is a big hit, but one guest
OL,10,     Fhas a restless night.
OL,11,G1650 Four in a Bed
OL,12,     FThe B&Bers are in the heart of
OL,13,     FBirmingham for the week's final
OL,14,     Fvisit, to The Ladbrooke Hotel.
OL,15,     FHost Snehal aims for perfection,
OL,16,     Fbut some guests think their rooms
OL,17,     Fare far from flawless.
