OL,5,G1720 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FIt's payment day, and one guest in
OL,7,     Fparticular is on the warpath.
OL,8,     FAfter some brekkie bust-ups and
OL,9,     Fplenty of tension, who will be
OL,10,     Fcrowned the best value B&B of the
OL,11,     Fweek?
OL,12,G1750 Car S.O.S
OL,13,     FFord Escort RS2000: Tim Shaw and
OL,14,     FFuzz Townshend visit Dorset to fix
OL,15,     Fup a Mk2 RS2000. It belongs to
OL,16,     Fcarpenter Mike, who gave up work
OL,17,     Fto support his son who had a
OL,18,     Fterrible accident.
