OL,9,     FCavalier Turbo for Darren, who was
OL,10,     Fleft tetraplegic after a horrific
OL,11,     Faccident.
OL,12,G1955 Grand Designs
OL,13,     FArchitect David Parsons has
OL,14,     Fdesigned a sleek, black-clad house
OL,15,     Fhidden away in an idyllic Essex
OL,16,     Fwoodland. But will having no
OL,17,     Fwindows on two sides make this
OL,18,     Fdream home into a bunker?
