OL,5,G2305 24 Hours in A&E
OL,6,     FThe St George's A&E team treat two
OL,7,     Ftrauma patients who arrive by
OL,8,     Fhelicopter on the hospital's new
OL,9,     Fhelipad. And Mihhail, who's 29,
OL,10,     Fhas crashed his motorcycle into a
OL,11,     Fbollard.
OL,12,G0010 999: On the Front Line
OL,13,     FThe paramedics are called out to a
OL,14,     Fwoman who's had a seizure on a
OL,15,     Fbus, a man who's too weak to reach
OL,16,     Fhis oxygen supply, and a young
OL,17,     Fwoman with terminal cancer who's
OL,18,     Fcollapsed.
